title: mystery_signal_start
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_click>>
Your comms array picks up an encrypted signal. It's repeating coordinates nearby. #line:mystery_signal_start_00
<<if quest_not_started("quest_signal_trace")>>
    -> Flag as Signal Trace Contract #line:mystery_signal_start_01 #quest
        <<start_quest quest_signal_trace>>
        <<jump mystery_signal_signal_source>>
<<endif>>
-> Investigate #line:mystery_signal_start_02
    <<reveal_clue rumor_hidden_research_station>>
    <<jump mystery_signal_signal_source>>
<<if quest_active("quest_signal_trace")>>
    -> Submit Signal Telemetry (Debug Complete) #line:mystery_signal_start_03 #quest
        <<complete_quest quest_signal_trace>>
        <<stop>>
<<endif>>
-> Ignore Signal #line:mystery_signal_start_04 #leave
    <<stop>>
===

title: mystery_signal_signal_source
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_click>>
Following the signal leads to a hidden research station. It appears abandoned... or is it? #line:mystery_signal_signal_source_00
-> Board the Station #line:mystery_signal_signal_source_01
    <<detour mystery_signal_station_interior>>
    <<jump mystery_signal_signal_source>>
-> Scan From Distance #line:mystery_signal_signal_source_02
    <<if roll(100) <= 60>>
    <<jump mystery_signal_scan_good>>
    <<else>>
    <<jump mystery_signal_scan_bad>>
    <<endif>>
-> Leave #line:mystery_signal_signal_source_03 #leave
    <<stop>>
===

title: mystery_signal_station_interior
tags: 
---
The station interior is dark. Emergency lights flash red. You hear strange sounds echoing through the halls. #line:mystery_signal_station_interior_00
-> Search Lab #line:mystery_signal_station_interior_01
    <<give_item resource_palladium 2>>
    <<return>>
-> Search Armory #line:mystery_signal_station_interior_02
    <<give_credits 250>>
    <<return>>
-> Go Deeper #line:mystery_signal_station_interior_03
    <<jump mystery_signal_station_deep>>
-> Back to Ship #line:mystery_signal_station_interior_04 #leave
    <<return>>
===

title: mystery_signal_station_deep
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_click>>
Deep inside you find an AI terminal still operational. It offers you a choice. #line:mystery_signal_station_deep_00
-> Download Data #line:mystery_signal_station_deep_01
    <<give_item item_ai_core_data 1>>
    <<add_fact research_points 25>>
    <<stop>>
-> Destroy the Terminal #line:mystery_signal_station_deep_02
    <<damage_ship 5>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: mystery_signal_scan_good
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_success>>
Long-range scans reveal the station contains valuable research data. #line:mystery_signal_scan_good_00
-> Board Now #line:mystery_signal_scan_good_01
    <<detour mystery_signal_station_interior>>
    <<jump mystery_signal_scan_good>>
-> Leave With Scan Data #line:mystery_signal_scan_good_02
    <<add_fact research_points 10>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: mystery_signal_scan_bad
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_fail>>
Your scan triggers an automated defense system! Turrets target your ship! #line:mystery_signal_scan_bad_00
-> Evade! #line:mystery_signal_scan_bad_01
    <<if roll(100) <= 70>>
    <<jump mystery_signal_evade_success>>
    <<else>>
    <<jump mystery_signal_evade_fail>>
    <<endif>>
===

title: mystery_signal_evade_success
tags: 
---
You dodge the turret fire and escape unscathed. #line:mystery_signal_evade_success_00
-> Continue #line:mystery_signal_evade_success_01
    <<stop>>
===

title: mystery_signal_evade_fail
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_fail>>
A turret blast grazes your hull before you can escape. #line:mystery_signal_evade_fail_00
-> Damage Report #line:mystery_signal_evade_fail_01
    <<damage_ship 15>>
    <<stop>>
===

